    PARTY `the Charity Tribunal` DOES `determine an appeal in one of the ways Part 8 allows` `remit the decision to the Commissioner` AT 20

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 34(3) the tribunal may determine the appeal` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Charity Tribunal` DOES `determine an appeal in one of the ways Part 8 allows` `substitute the decision of the tribunal or court for that of the Commissioner` AT 20

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 34(3) the tribunal may determine the appeal` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Charity Tribunal` DOES `determine an appeal in one of the ways Part 8 allows` `dismiss the appeal` AT 20

-- A way that is the court's, not the tribunal's, does not discharge the permission.
-- EXPECT: STANDING MAY
#TRACE `Art 34(3) the tribunal may determine the appeal` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Charity Tribunal` DOES `determine an appeal in one of the ways Part 8 allows` `substitute the decision of the court for that of the tribunal` AT 20

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 34(3) the tribunal may determine the appeal` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    -- no events

