#ASSERT `Art 35(1) reading B: the ground is one Article 34(1) allows or that the decision was unreasonable` (`Ground alleged in an appeal` WITH `standard alleged` IS `unreasonable`, `respect alleged` IS `all the circumstances of the case`)
#ASSERT NOT `Art 35(1) reading B: the ground is one Article 34(1) allows or that the decision was unreasonable` (`Ground alleged in an appeal` WITH `standard alleged` IS `wrong`, `respect alleged` IS `some other respect`)

-- 36(2): the day the limit runs from (F8.6) and its last day (F8.12), called directly.
#ASSERT `Art 36(2) the day the time limit runs from` `the favoured interpretation` `T36 an appeal lodged on 5 February 2026` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 10
#ASSERT `Art 36(2) the day the time limit runs from` `the interpretation with the other reading of F8.6` `T36 an appeal lodged on 5 February 2026` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 1
#ASSERT REFUSED `Art 36(2) the day the time limit runs from` `the favoured interpretation` `T36 an appeal lodged on 5 February 2026, no notice given` BECAUSE "notice of the decision has not been given, and on this reading the time limit runs from the notice"
#ASSERT `Art 36(2) the day the time limit runs from` `the interpretation with the other reading of F8.6` `T36 an appeal lodged on 5 February 2026, no notice given` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 1
#ASSERT `Art 36(2)(a) the last day of the time limit` `the favoured interpretation` (YMD 2026 1 10) 30 EQUALS YMD 2026 2 9
#ASSERT `Art 36(2)(a) the last day of the time limit` `the interpretation with the other reading of F8.12` (YMD 2026 1 10) 30 EQUALS YMD 2026 2 8
#ASSERT `Art 36(2)(a) the last day of the time limit` `the favoured interpretation` (YMD 2026 12 20) 30 EQUALS YMD 2027 1 19

§ `Tests of the round trip from the decisions of Articles 26 and 27 to the right of appeal in Article 33(3) (IP27)`

-- The producer's decision, handed to Article 33: the person served may appeal the decision to impose a requirement, and has nothing to appeal where the Commissioner decided not to impose it.
GIVEN imposed IS A BOOLEAN
      decide IS A `Decision of the Commissioner`
GIVETH A `Right of appeal under Article 33`
`T33 the right of the person served against the decision` imposed decide MEANS
    `Art 33 the right of appeal` `the favoured interpretation`
        (`Appeal under Article 33` WITH
            appellant IS `T33 a person served with a notice`
            `decision appealed` IS decide
            `the decision concerns the appellant's own application or registration` IS FALSE)
        TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `Art 26 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` TRUE EQUALS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `T33 Article 26 requirement`, `T33 does`
#ASSERT `Art 26 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` FALSE EQUALS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `T33 Article 26 requirement`, `T33 refuses`
#ASSERT `Art 27 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` TRUE EQUALS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `T33 required steps requirement`, `T33 does`
#ASSERT `Art 27 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` FALSE EQUALS `Decision of the Commissioner` OF `T33 required steps requirement`, `T33 refuses`
#ASSERT `T33 the right of the person served against the decision` TRUE (`Art 26 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` TRUE) EQUALS `a right of appeal under Article 33(3)`
#ASSERT `T33 the right of the person served against the decision` FALSE (`Art 26 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` FALSE) EQUALS `no appeal is given by Part 8`
#ASSERT `T33 the right of the person served against the decision` TRUE (`Art 27 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` TRUE) EQUALS `a right of appeal under Article 33(3)`
#ASSERT `T33 the right of the person served against the decision` FALSE (`Art 27 the decision of the Commissioner to impose a requirement` FALSE) EQUALS `no appeal is given by Part 8`

